@startuml
title Doggy's - UML API Gateway y Politicas de Seguridad

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0


class ApiGateway {
  +routeRequest()
  +authenticate()
  +authorize()
  +propagateIdentity()
}


class RouteDefinition {
  +path: string
  +method: string
  +targetService: string
  +requiresAuth: boolean
}


class AuthenticationPolicy {
  +validateSession()
  +introspectToken()
}


class AuthorizationPolicy {
  +validateRole()
  +validateOwnership()
  +validateOperation()
}


class SecretProvider {
  +getSecret(reference)
  +rotateSecret(reference)
}


class AuthService {
  +login()
  +introspect()
  +logout()
}


class GraphQLGateway {
  +resumenPedido(pedidoId)
}


class InventoryService {
  +getProducts()
  +getProduct(id)
}


class OrdersService {
  +getOrders()
  +getOrder(id)
  +createOrder()
}


class ClientsService {
  +getClient(id)
  +updateClient(id)
}


class PaymentsService {
  +createPayment()
  +confirmPayment(id)
}


class VerifiedIdentity {
  +userId: string
  +username: string
  +roles: list
}


ApiGateway "1" *-- "1..*" RouteDefinition

ApiGateway "1" --> "1" AuthenticationPolicy
ApiGateway "1" --> "1" AuthorizationPolicy

ApiGateway ..> SecretProvider : obtiene secretos
ApiGateway ..> AuthService : login / introspection / logout

AuthenticationPolicy ..> AuthService
AuthorizationPolicy ..> VerifiedIdentity

ApiGateway ..> InventoryService
ApiGateway ..> OrdersService
ApiGateway ..> ClientsService
ApiGateway ..> PaymentsService
ApiGateway ..> GraphQLGateway


GraphQLGateway ..> OrdersService
GraphQLGateway ..> InventoryService


note right of ApiGateway
Punto de entrada externo.

Valida sesion,
aplica autorizacion,
limita rutas y propaga
identidad verificada.
end note


note right of SecretProvider
Representa HashiCorp Vault
u otro gestor de secretos.

Nunca expone secretos
al navegador.
end note


note right of GraphQLGateway
Servicio privado.

Agrega informacion de
orders + inventory.
end note


note bottom of AuthorizationPolicy
La autorizacion considera:

- rol
- recurso
- propiedad
- operacion
end note


@enduml